WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:03.795
(dramatic music)

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:08.800
Can I help -

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.343
Stop. That's enough, okay?

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.435
Maybe you should - you should...

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:28.153
(somber music)

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:43.752
♪ Like the sweet morning dew ♪

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:49.007
♪ I took one look at you ♪

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:56.097
♪ And it was plain to see ♪

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:59.267
♪ You were my destiny ♪

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:08.109
♪ With my arms open wide
I threw away my pride ♪

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:13.073
♪ I'll sacrifice for you,
dedicate my life to you ♪

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:17.952
♪ I will go where you lead,
always there in time of need ♪

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:20.288
♪ And when I lose my will, ♪

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:22.874
♪ You'll be there to push me up the hill ♪

00:01:22.874 --> 00:01:27.837
♪ There's no, no looking back for us ♪

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:32.759
♪ We got love, sure enough that's enough ♪

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:37.013
♪ You're all, all that I need ♪

00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:42.018
♪ to get by ♪

00:01:43.186 --> 00:01:48.149
♪ 'Cause we, we got the right foundation ♪

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:52.821
♪ And with love and determination ♪

00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:57.242
♪ You're all, all that
I wanna strive for ♪

00:01:57.242 --> 00:01:58.326
♪ Do a little more ♪

00:01:58.326 --> 00:02:03.373
♪ You're all, all the joys under
the sun wrapped into one, ♪

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.793
♪ You're all, all that I need ♪

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:09.379
(ears ringing)

00:02:36.573 --> 00:02:40.535
♪ All that I need ♪

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:43.663
♪ to get by ♪

